{
    "title": "GPS Tracker & Speedometer",
    "description": "Effortlessly track your car rides, runs, walks, or bike rides using your phone's built-in GPS. Switch between map, digital or analog speedometer.\r\n\r\nApp can continue to record your route and speed in the background while you use your phone for something else. Pause, stop and resume your tracking at any time.\r\n\r\nMain app features:\r\n- Use phone GPS to record your routes and speed\r\n- App shortcuts to start/stop recording with one tap\r\n- Analog & Digital speedometer\r\n- Head-up display / HUD mode\r\n- Odometer\r\n- Fuel cost estimation\r\n- History of saved tracks\r\n- Download tracks in .gpx file format\r\n- Share current location from map view \u2013 as image or text\r\n- Share recorded routes as map image\r\n- Map follows current location while tracking\r\n- Set maximum speed and get over speed alerts, even when app is in background\r\n- Dark and light theme\r\n- Change map type from map view \u2013 light, dark or terrain\r\n- Switch between kilometers and miles\r\n- Portrait and landscape orientation of gauges\r\n\r\nGPS Tracker & Speedometer allows you to download your routes in .gpx file format so you can view your routes in third party software.\r\n\r\nNo locked Features\r\nAll features are 100% FREE. You can use all features without having to pay for them.\r\n\r\n100% Private\r\nNo sign-in required. We will not collect Personally Identifiable Information and will not share any with third parties.\r\n\r\nStart, Pause, Stop\r\nYou can pause and start, stop the GPS tracker at any time to save power.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Effortlessly track your car rides, runs, walks, or bike rides using your phone&#39;s built-in GPS. Switch between map, digital or analog speedometer.<br><br>App can continue to record your route and speed in the background while you use your phone for something else. Pause, stop and resume your tracking at any time.<br><br>Main app features:<br>- Use phone GPS to record your routes and speed<br>- App shortcuts to start/stop recording with one tap<br>- Analog &amp; Digital speedometer<br>- Head-up display / HUD mode<br>- Odometer<br>- Fuel cost estimation<br>- History of saved tracks<br>- Download tracks in .gpx file format<br>- Share current location from map view \u2013 as image or text<br>- Share recorded routes as map image<br>- Map follows current location while tracking<br>- Set maximum speed and get over speed alerts, even when app is in background<br>- Dark and light theme<br>- Change map type from map view \u2013 light, dark or terrain<br>- Switch between kilometers and miles<br>- Portrait and landscape orientation of gauges<br><br>GPS Tracker &amp; Speedometer allows you to download your routes in .gpx file format so you can view your routes in third party software.<br><br>No locked Features<br>All features are 100% FREE. You can use all features without having to pay for them.<br><br>100% Private<br>No sign-in required. We will not collect Personally Identifiable Information and will not share any with third parties.<br><br>Start, Pause, Stop<br>You can pause and start, stop the GPS tracker at any time to save power.",
